    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Ryan,<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your answer. That solves part of my problem. Unfortunately, my tree is incredibly big and unless I get a clue on how to order the colors in the scale, I won&#39;t be able to apply your solution. As of now, I have the colors of the otus and a dataframe with the color of the tips.</div></div>"
