     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Maybe this <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19778612/change-color-for-two-geom-point-in-ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19778612/change-color-for-two-geom-point-in-ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482804349000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mFc0GdEhfQPsCVgmkpHt2\">post on stackoverflow</a> will be helpful. From the example above this would be:<div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
